␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='vi'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><title>Da luu WiFi</title><style>body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#0f172a;color:#e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;padding:16px}.card{background:#1e293b;border-radius:16px;padding:32px 28px;max-width:360px;width:100%;text-align:center}.icon{font-size:56px;margin-bottom:16px}h2{color:#22c55e;margin-bottom:10px}p{color:#64748b;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}</style></head><body><div class='card'><div class='icon'>вњ…</div><h2>ДђГЈ lЖ°u thГ nh cГґng!</h2><p>Bб»™ sбєЎc Д‘ang khб»џi Д‘б»™ng lбєЎi vГ  kбєїt nб»‘i vГ o WiFi mб»›i.<br><br>Vui lГІng kбєїt nб»‘i lбєЎi Д‘iб»‡n thoбєЎi vГ o mбєЎng WiFi nhГ  bбєЎn<br>vГ  mб»џ б»©ng dб»Ґng MPPT nhЖ° bГ¬nh thЖ°б»ќng.</p></div></body></html>␀␀<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='vi'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Cap Nhat WiFi - Bo Sac MPPT</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#0f172a;color:#e2e8f0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}.card{background:#1e293b;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:16px;padding:32px 28px;max-width:400px;width:100%;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}.logo{font-size:40px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:12px}h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px}.sub{font-size:13px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:1.5}label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px}input{width:100%;padding:11px 14px;background:#0f172a;border:1.5px solid #334155;border-radius:8px;color:#e2e8f0;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:14px}input:focus{outline:none;border-color:#6366f1}.btn{width:100%;padding:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#8b5cf6);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.note{font-size:12px;color:#64748b;text-align:center;margin-top:14px;line-height:1.5}</style></head><body><div class='card'><div class='logo'>рџ“Ў</div><h2>Cбє­p nhбє­t WiFi вЂ” Bб»™ sбєЎc MPPT</h2><div class='sub'>Nhбє­p thГґng tin mбєЎng WiFi mб»›i Д‘б»ѓ bб»™ sбєЎc kбєїt nб»‘i lбєЎi.</div><form method='POST' action='/save'><label>TГЄn WiFi (SSID)</label><input name='ssid' placeholder='TГЄn mбєЎng WiFi...' required maxlength='32'><label>Mбє­t khбє©u WiFi</label><input name='pass' type='password' placeholder='Дђб»ѓ trб»‘ng nбєїu khГґng cГі mбє­t khбє©u' maxlength='64'><button class='btn' type='submit'>рџ’ѕ LЖ°u vГ  kбєїt nб»‘i lбєЎi</button></form><div class='note'>вљ™пёЏ Sau khi nhбєҐn LЖ°u, bб»™ sбєЎc sбєЅ tб»± khб»џi Д‘б»™ng lбєЎi<br>vГ  kбєїt nб»‘i vГ o WiFi mб»›i trong vГ i giГўy.</div></div></body></html>␀␀␀␀␀ B␀␀VB␀␀HC␀␀аB␀␀–B␀␀aB␀␀fC␀␀PA␀␀HB␀␀рB␀␀рA␀␀ИA␀␀CC␀␀␀0␀␀А@␀␀@@НМL@␀␀AНМL?НММ>…k?␀␀␀?B`e<␀␀pB␀␀\B␀␀ZC␀␀ A␀␀ A␀␀␀A␀␀8Aљ™@љ™™?fff?јt“;␀␀ґB␀␀ @љ™™>␀␀А?␀␀Ђ?љ™>)\Џ<␀␀а@␀␀`A®Gб<␀␀€A␀␀␀B␀␀(Bff†?НМЊ?
